theorem applies with no core terms; by (H6) the surface integral vanishes … Explicitly:
 d/dt ∫_Ω w_m d³x = Γ_⊥ ∫_Ω ∂_k Π_km d³x = Γ_⊥ ∮_∂Ω Π_km n_k dS = 0."

