* **Not formalisable as written (G5 §3.5), carried as prose, never a `sorry`:** existence/uniqueness
  "standard" (Note L891, here the named Lipschitz input); the one-line (iv) decay rate with its
  undefined `K_min` and order-of-magnitude `q_min∼2π/L` (here the named `SpectralGapDecay`); the
